    "sections": {
        "description": "NewsCom is a WordPress theme designed for news websites, online magazines, blogs, and other content-focused sites. Built on the ReviewNews theme framework, it uses a dark color scheme and includes customizable header and footer layouts compatible with the Block Editor (Gutenberg) and popular page builders such as Elementor, Divi, and Brizy. The theme provides multiple layout options, built-in widgets, block patterns, and starter site designs, and supports WooCommerce, AMP, responsive layouts, multilingual and RTL languages. NewsCom is developed following WordPress coding standards with consideration for accessibility, SEO structure, and performance compatibility. Explore all features at https://afthemes.com/products/newscom/"
    },
